From 0e13b85943289addd6593c517cc49bf42bb31e74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 16:50:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ProseOthello in Games, and ProseJulia among the Demos

ProseOthello 0.1 (proseothello-0.1-1, built by prosepkg from
proseothello/app): Reversi against the machine, every legal square
circled, four levels from random to exact endings -- joins the games
folder of the Deskbar's Applications menu.

ProseJulia 0.1-2 moves from Office to the Deskbar's Demos menu: it
installs into the demos directory (which is what that menu shows) and no
longer carries an Applications entry. A fractal is a demo.

Prose-Patch: 0097-proseothello-in-games-and-prosejulia-among-the-demos.patch 3b0bf6faebbf2857883574503141be2f61fd2ed26f01e0eed960ba3c77b0f78a
